---
description: Datathon project rules and team coordination
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow the project rules in AGENTS.md (repo root): read it, docs/kb/README.md and docs/INTERFACES.md at the start of every session; run `python tools/kb.py show` to see all teammates' status; after EVERY update, edit your own team file docs/kb/team/<your-area>.md in the kb worktree (`python tools/kb.py sync` prints its path) and run `python tools/kb.py publish <your-area> "message"`. No number without a verified claim; nobody grades their own work; never invent patch versions, URLs, model IDs or statistics; no secrets in git.
